# Without the route, the handler is never served and POST /v1/accounts is answered 405.

title: the account endpoint exists and nothing serves it
file: internal/ledgerhttp/ledgerhttp.go
run: make db-reset && go test -count=1 -run TestAnAccountIsOpenedOverHTTPAndIsThenReadable -v ./internal/ledgerhttp/
--- before
	mux.HandleFunc("POST /v1/accounts", s.openAccount)
--- after
	// negative control: the handler is written and the mux does not know
